{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220205001:1":{"text":"떠나려고 하신다고 들었어요. 이유가 뭔가요?","source_cn":"听说你要走了，为什么呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE756EC84CEB97123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220205002:1":{"text":"어렵게 결정한 거니까, 날 흔들 생각은 하지 말라고! 난 이미 결심했어!","source_cn":"我好不容易下定决心了，你们可别来动摇我嚯！我不会改变主意的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DC2452B28DD4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1220205002":{"text":"어렵게 결정한 거니까, 날 흔들 생각은 하지 말라고! 난 이미 결심했어!","source_cn":"我好不容易下定决心了，你们可别来动摇我嚯！我不会改变主意的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DC2452B28DD4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220205003:1":{"text":"너희가 알아도 상관은 없어. \n난 말이야, <style=\"highlight\">세상을 바꿀 위대한 발명품</style>을 만들 거야!","source_cn":"告诉你们也没关系。\\n我啊，要去做<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC49AF08785F8A901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220205005:1":{"text":"세상을 바꿀...","source_cn":"改变世界的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CE9C2C5722F4D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen