title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220205010:1":{"text":"하지만 후긴 씨의 통신기는 누구나 사용할 수 있고 만드는 법도 간단해서...","source_cn":"但你的通讯器，任何人都能使用，制造起来也很简单……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CD00B0F82543A19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220205011:1":{"text":"보급된다면, 분명 세상을 바꿀 수 있을 거예요!\n그거야말로 아주 위대한 발명이죠!","source_cn":"如果能推广，那绝对可以改变世界！\\n已经是非常伟大的发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6927F2FA2FC1224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220205012:1":{"text":"하하하, 멀린다베스트는 당연히 훌륭하지! 하지만 그걸론 부족해!","source_cn":"哈哈哈，小梅当然很棒！但是这还不够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC66B52A0F907A57B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220205013:1":{"text":"그럼 어떤 걸 발명하고 싶은데요?","source_cn":"那你想发明什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84CDCBFDEA8C24A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220205014:1":{"text":"음, 크흠, 나도 아직 뭘 발명해야 할지 모르겠어...","source_cn":"呃，咳咳，我也没想好到底要发明什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE5B951201F7527F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220205015:1":{"text":"하지만 모르